OL,3,GNEWSACannabis concerns raised after
OL,4,Aman's fire death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mental health of a man who died in
OL,7,Fa fire had deteriorated due to his use
OL,8,Fof medicinal cannabis, an inquest has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FSixty-six-year-old David Morgan died in
OL,12,F2025 from breathing in smoke in his
OL,13,Fflat.
OL,15,FPresiding over the hearing, Deputy
OL,16,FViscount Matt Berry said Morgan's use
OL,17,Fof prescribed cannabis products
OL,18,Fcontributed to his mental decline, and
OL,19,Fhis mental state contributed to the
OL,20,Fcircumstances of his death.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
