OL,3,GNEWSACannabis concerns raised after
OL,4,Aman's fire death
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the health minister
OL,7,Fsaid a consultation about cannabis
OL,8,Fprescribing would begin this month,
OL,9,Fahead of creating a full licensing
OL,10,Fscheme. Berry recommended cannabis
OL,11,Fproducts were not prescribed to new
OL,12,Fpatients with mental health conditions
OL,13,Fwhile this was under way.
